  "mukhattat": 1,
  "wasf": "The bundled fonts, pinned by content hash. Every entry was fetched from the source named here and verified to be a TrueType/OpenType file; the staging tool refuses any entry without a sha256 and any download whose bytes do not match one. Paths in wajha are exactly the malaf values of assets/fonts/khutut.json, so the staged tree and the font manifest cannot drift.",
  "makhbaa": "target/tajmee/makhbaa",
  "tahaqquq": "2026-09-05: all 34 entries fetched and re-verified; 34 of 34 hashes matched, and every hajm equals the fetched length. Each of the 25 faces was then read with its own table directory and checked against Decision 6 as taarib-saff implements it: the 19 faces of the eight Arabic families all carry cmap, GSUB and GPOS, the GSUB features init/medi/fina/rlig, the GPOS feature mark, and all 40 characters of HURUF_MATLUBA. The 6 Latin and mono faces do not, and are not meant to — they are loaded through MawridKhatt::jadeed_latini. Not one of the 25 declares isol, which is why the validator does not ask for it.",
